cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bartini+: stochastic time selection in 3+3 geometry"
message: "Cite this repository if you use the proofs or the code."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kutepov
    given-names: Alexander
    alias: AlexKutepov
