  - name: "Large language models (Cursor research chain, 2026)"
    alias: LLM
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/AlexKutepov/bartini-plus"
abstract: >-
  Open reconstruction of R. O. di Bartini's dimensional argument for n=6,
  analysis of 3+3 geometry, and a stochastic extension (Bartini+) with
  nonlinear Pólya-urn lock-in of one observed time. Numerical tests L0–L3.
  Hypothesis posed by Alexander Kutepov; mathematics and simulations
  produced jointly with LLMs. Does not claim a proof that the Universe is
  six-dimensional.
